<title>FINLAND: Neste Jan-April unchanged, below forecasts.</title>
<headline>Neste Jan-April unchanged, below forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     214 vs 219</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.90 vs 1.65</p>
<p> Net sales					 14,689 vs 14,410</p>
<p> Operating profit				   412 vs 405</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 12 analysts' forecasts for Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy's profit before extras, tax had been 431 million markka in a 233-600 million range.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 910 vs 881</p>
<p> Depreciation					 498 vs 476</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 198 vs 186 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 70 vs 58 gain</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		284 vs 277</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 24 vs 30 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						    3 vs 27</p>
<p> Net profit					   257 vs 220</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    40.2 vs 37.6</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (percent)	     4.3 vs 4.0</p>
<p> Gearing					     75.3 vs 77.6</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Neste Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
